  "steps": [
    "Press the tofu for 10 minutes, then toss the cubes with the cornflour and a pinch of salt to coat.",
    "Fry in 2 tbsp hot oil, turning, until golden and crisp on all sides. Lift out and set aside.",
    "Whisk the soy, maple syrup and rice vinegar together. In the same pan, sizzle the garlic and ginger for 30 seconds, then pour in the sauce and let it bubble and thicken.",
    "Return the tofu to the pan and toss until every piece is glazed and sticky. Scatter with sesame seeds.",
    "Quickly sear the broccoli in the remaining oil with a splash of water until bright and just tender.",
    "Serve over rice with the greens and a shower of spring onions."
  ],
  "notes": "Cornflour is the trick to crisp tofu without deep-frying. For extra heat, add a teaspoon of chilli-garlic sauce to the glaze."
}
